/**
 * moon-texture.js
 * NASA lunar surface photomosaic, embedded as a base64 data URI.
 *
 * Why embedded instead of loaded from assets/moon.jpg: browsers block
 * or silently hang WebGL texture loads for local images when a page is
 * opened directly (file://) rather than served over http, because
 * three.js requests the image with a CORS crossOrigin attribute that
 * file:// URLs cannot satisfy — the sphere just stays plain white with
 * no error. A data: URI has no cross-origin request at all, so the
 * texture always loads, whether you double-click index.html or serve
 * it from a web server.
 */
